  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<b>ASCENDING INFERNO</b> is your ultimate goal in this gorgeous, challenging-but-fair 2.5D precision platformer with a ball.<p></p>\n<p>Playing as Dani, it’s not enough to run, jump and platform your way out of Hell – you’ll need to dribble, kick and header her dead brother Vincent’s ball-shaped soul along with you!</p>\n<p>Just be sure you don’t fumble the ball – the depths of Hell is a long way to fall…</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Master precision platforming</b> with a ball (actually your brother’s soul).\n</li><li><b>Bask in a handcrafted world</b> of gorgeous pixel and voxel art.\n</li><li><b>Ascend nine challenging layers</b> of a modernized Dante’s Inferno.\n</li><li><b>Tackle unique mechanics</b> in each layer of Hell – Limbo, Lust, Gluttony and beyond.\n</li><li><b>Take your time or beat the clock</b> in a game built with speedrunners in mind.\n</li><li><b>Uncover a hidden story</b> scattered across secret rooms in each level.\n</li><li><b>Unlock free cosmetics</b> for Dani and Vincent by completing in-game challenges.\n</li></ul>\n",
